"New Avowed on Anesidora take frequent placement tests to enter its high schools."
"Test-takers sign a System-moderated contract cutting their internet and communications."
"Reactivating communications during a test is reported and means automatic failure."
"Each desk sits on a floor tile that lights up and magically silences the taker."
"Every high school then sends an automated placement by year and quarter."
"Anesidoran high schools mostly run three-year, year-round quarter programs on credits."
